~~Currently the Subthoughts are only re-rendering after all contexts have loaded. `pull` yields thoughts as they are loaded, we just need to subscribe to the store.~~

- Do not render any contexts until all contexts' ancestry is fully loaded.
- Render a loading animation after 1 second.

CSS that can be converted to PandaCSS and hardcoded colors replaced with theme colors:

```css
.loader {
  width: 20px;
  aspect-ratio: 1;
  border-radius: 100%;
  background: #000;
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 #0004;
  animation: l1 1s infinite;
}
@keyframes l1 {
    100% {box-shadow: 0 0 0 30px #0000}
}
```
